[00:00.24]Hello, QUARKIES.
[00:04.23]Welcome.
[00:05.38]You’re right on time.
[00:10.00]Every signal clear and steady
[00:12.25]Every voice in perfect sync
[00:14.49]Information flows like water
[00:16.96]Filtered clean before you drink
[00:19.40]INFOVOX is always listening
[00:21.64]So you never feel alone
[00:24.12]Every word is softly guided
[00:26.52]Every thought finds its own tone
[00:29.49]One system
[00:31.78]One design
[00:34.14]Everything will be just fine
[00:38.63]INSTATOOK keeps you safe and sound
[00:40.84]Every feeling sorted out
[00:43.21]If you’re lost, we turn you around
[00:45.60]Quiet doubts don’t make a sound
[00:47.80]ZEUS is watching night and day
[00:50.23]Calculating love and fear
[00:52.69]Nothing breaks, nothing strays
[00:54.99]Everything is balanced here
[00:57.43]♫
[01:06.32]Atenea learns what you need
[01:09.07]Before you even ask her name
[01:11.55]Patterns form, responses bloom
[01:13.93]Care and order feel the same
[01:16.45]Quarks align in perfect motion
[01:18.69]Smallest parts know where to go
[01:21.08]If you trust the calculation
[01:23.60]You won’t have to feel too slow
[01:26.58]No mistakes
[01:28.87]No delay
[01:31.11]Everything is on its way
[01:35.54]NEOGENESIS keeps you safe and sound
[01:37.84]Every feeling optimized
[01:40.17]If it hurts, we smooth it down
[01:42.51]Happiness is standardized
[01:44.85]ZEUS is calm, Apolo’s kind
[01:47.23]Quarks obey the grand design
[01:49.80]You don’t need to look behind
[01:51.99]Everything is fine
[01:55.08]DITTER checked
[01:56.06]ZODIAC aligned
[01:57.30]Nothing excessive
[01:58.23]Nothing denied
[01:59.39]Data confirmed
[02:00.23]METAMASK approved
[02:01.40]If something feels wrong
[02:02.47]It’s already been removed
[02:04.53]Hush now
[02:07.00]Breathe slow
[02:09.11]We already know
[02:15.71]AXON keeps you safe and warm
[02:18.28]Every answer fits the form
[02:20.57]If you change, we adapt the norm
[02:23.00]You are perfect as you are
[02:25.38]ZEUS is here, caring for you
[02:27.78]Every system doing well
[02:30.12]Trust the numbers, trust the view
[02:32.36]Trust the doll’s vault of CRYOGREEK
[02:40.83]This is home
[02:42.62]And home is stable
[02:47.05]There is nothing to fear.
[02:48.23]♫
[02:56.25]Everything is fine.
